  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The bonds you forge with your squadron stretch as far as your thoughts</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Collective, Squadron Commander<sup>USoP</sup> or Troop Commander<sup>HiH</sup>.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The maximum number of creatures in your squadron increases to the maximum number of creatures in your collective. You may add a creature to your squadron as part of the action to add it to your collective. You treat any creatures in your collective as being within close range for the purpose of targeting them with your feats and talents.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
